m double-seam tin capping or retort pouch sealing for long-term ambient shelf life.'),(2439,196,'_page_builder_3_process_steps_3_step_description','field_6aa44ab621cfc'),(2440,196,'page_builder_3_process_steps','4'),(2441,196,'_page_builder_3_process_steps','field_6aa44a8821cf9'),(2442,196,'page_builder_4_faq_tag','Client Queries'),(2443,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_tag','field_6aa44c3bae1d2'),(2444,196,'page_builder_4_faq_title','Frequently Asked Questions'),(2445,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_title','field_6aa44c49ae1d3'),(2446,196,'page_builder_4_faq_description','Answers regarding FSSAI compliance, minimum batch sizes, and contract processing.'),(2447,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_description','field_6aa44c59ae1d4'),(2448,196,'page_builder_4_faq_items_0_faq_question','What is the minimum batch size for custom contract canning?'),(2449,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_0_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(2450,196,'page_builder_4_faq_items_0_faq_answer','We cater to small-scale farmers and cottage preservers starting from 25 KG batches up to commercial production runs of 1,000+ KG per day.'),(2451,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_0_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(2452,196,'page_builder_4_faq_items_1_faq_question','Is FSSAI certification included for packed items?'),(2453,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_1_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(2454,196,'page_builder_4_faq_items_1_faq_answer','<div class=\"faq-item active\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-body\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-content\">Yes, all processing and hermetic canning is executed under Asal Canning Center\'s FSSAI License No. 10718026000263 following strict hygiene and thermal pasteurization rules.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(2455,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_1_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(2456,196,'page_builder_4_faq_items_2_faq_question','Do you offer packaging options for export orders?'),(2457,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_2_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(2458,196,'page_builder_4_faq_items_2_faq_answer','<div class=\"faq-item active\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-body\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-content\">Yes, we support hermetic tin canning (850g), retort pouch packing (1kg), glass bottles (500g), and ceramic jar packing suitable for international transport and long-term shelf storage.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(2459,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_2_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(2460,196,'page_builder_4_faq_items_3_faq_question','How are fruit pulps preserved without artificial chemicals?'),(2461,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_3_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(2462,196,'page_builder_4_faq_items_3_faq_answer','<div class=\"faq-item active\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-body\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-content\">We utilize thermal pasteurization, hermetic double-seam vacuum sealing, and flash freezing. This eliminates microbial activity while preserving 100% natural fruit taste, color, and nutrient profile without added chemical preservatives.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(2463,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_3_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(2464,196,'page_builder_4_faq_items_4_faq_question','Can I request custom private label packaging for my food brand?'),(2465,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_4_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(2466,196,'page_builder_4_faq_items_4_faq_answer','<div class=\"faq-item active\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-body\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-content\">Absolutely. We offer white-label contract processing and custom pouch/can/jar labeling with full regulatory compliance and nutritional breakdown for domestic and export markets.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(2467,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_4_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(2468,196,'page_builder_4_faq_items_5_faq_question','Where is Asal Canning Center located & what are facility visiting hours?'),(2469,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_5_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(2470,196,'page_builder_4_faq_items_5_faq_answer','We are located in Paldi, Ahmedabad, Gujarat. Visitors and clients are welcome Monday through Saturday from 9:00 AM to 7:00 PM for facility tours and batch consultations.'),(2471,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_5_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(2472,196,'page_builder_4_faq_items','6'),(2473,196,'_page_builder_4_faq_items','field_6aa44c68ae1d5'),(2474,196,'page_builder_5_gallery_tag','Infrastructure & Operations'),(2475,196,'_page_builder_5_gallery_tag','field_6aa450fc1babc'),(2476,196,'page_builder_5_gallery_title','State-of-the-Art Canning Center & Facility'),(2477,196,'_page_builder_5_gallery_title','field_6aa4510a1babd'),(2478,196,'page_builder_5_gallery_description','A glimpse into our hygienic extraction machinery, thermal autoclaves, and cottage processing workshops.'),(2479,196,'_page_builder_5_gallery_description','field_6aa451191babe'),(2480,196,'page_builder_5_gallery_button','a:3:{s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"View Complete Facility Gallery\";s:3:\"url\";s:43:\"http://localhost/asalcanningcenter/gallery/\";s:6:\"target\";s:0:\"\";}'),(2481,196,'_page_builder_5_gallery_button','field_6aa4512b1babf'),(2482,196,'page_builder_5_gallery_items_0_gallery_image','173'),(2483,196,'_page_builder_5_gallery_items_0_gallery_image','field_6aa4514a1bac1'),(2484,196,'page_builder_5_gallery_items_0_gallery_title','Stainless Steel Fruit Pulper'),(2485,196,'_page_builder_5_gallery_items_0_gallery_title','field_6aa451601bac2'),(2486,196,'page_builder_5_gallery_items_0_gallery_subtitle','Hygienic Extraction Equipment'),(2487,196,'_page_builder_5_gallery_items_0_gallery_subtitle','field_6aa4516f1bac3'),(2488,196,'page_builder_5_gallery_items_1_gallery_image','172'),(2489,196,'_page_builder_5_gallery_items_1_gallery_image','field_6aa4514a1bac1'),(2490,196,'page_builder_5_gallery_items_1_gallery_title','Alphonso Mango Extraction'),(2491,196,'_page_builder_5_gallery_items_1_gallery_title','field_6aa451601bac2'),(2492,196,'page_builder_5_gallery_items_1_gallery_subtitle','Pure Seasonal Batching'),(2493,196,'_page_builder_5_gallery_items_1_gallery_subtitle','field_6a