essing.'),(5002,377,'_page_builder_4_faq_description','field_6aa44c59ae1d4'),(5003,377,'page_builder_4_faq_items_0_faq_question','What is the minimum batch size for custom contract canning?'),(5004,377,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_0_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(5005,377,'page_builder_4_faq_items_0_faq_answer','We cater to small-scale farmers and cottage preservers starting from 25 KG batches up to commercial production runs of 1,000+ KG per day.'),(5006,377,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_0_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(5007,377,'page_builder_4_faq_items_1_faq_question','Is FSSAI certification included for packed items?'),(5008,377,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_1_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(5009,377,'page_builder_4_faq_items_1_faq_answer','Yes, all processing and hermetic canning is executed under Asal Canning Center\'s FSSAI License No. 10718026000263 following strict hygiene and thermal pasteurization rules.'),(5010,377,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_1_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(5011,377,'page_builder_4_faq_items_2_faq_question','Do you offer packaging options for export orders?'),(5012,377,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_2_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(5013,377,'page_builder_4_faq_items_2_faq_answer','Yes, we support hermetic tin canning (850g), retort pouch packing (1kg), glass bottles (500g), and ceramic jar packing suitable for international transport and long-term shelf storage.'),(5014,377,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_2_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(5015,377,'page_builder_4_faq_items_3_faq_question','How are fruit pulps preserved without artificial chemicals?'),(5016,377,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_3_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(5017,377,'page_builder_4_faq_items_3_faq_answer','We utilize thermal pasteurization, hermetic double-seam vacuum sealing, and flash freezing. This eliminates microbial activity while preserving 100% natural fruit taste, color, and nutrient profile without added chemical preservatives.'),(5018,377,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_3_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(5019,377,'page_builder_4_faq_items_4_faq_question','Can I request custom private label packaging for my food brand?'),(5020,377,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_4_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(5021,377,'page_builder_4_faq_items_4_faq_answer','Absolutely. We offer white-label contract processing and custom pouch/can/jar labeling with full regulatory compliance and nutritional breakdown for domestic and export markets.'),(5022,377,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_4_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(5023,377,'page_builder_4_faq_items_5_faq_question','Where is Asal Canning Center located & what are facility visiting hours?'),(5024,377,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_5_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(5025,377,'page_builder_4_faq_items_5_faq_answer','We are located in Paldi, Ahmedabad, Gujarat. Visitors and clients are welcome Monday through Saturday from 9:00 AM to 7:00 PM for facility tours and batch consultations.'),(5026,377,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_5_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(5027,377,'page_builder_4_faq_items','6'),(5028,377,'_page_builder_4_faq_items','field_6aa44c68ae1d5'),(5029,377,'page_builder_5_gallery_tag','Infrastructure & Operations'),(5030,377,'_page_builder_5_gallery_tag','field_6aa450fc1babc'),(5031,377,'page_builder_5_gallery_title','State-of-the-Art Canning Center & Facility'),(5032,377,'_page_builder_5_gallery_title','field_6aa4510a1babd'),(5033,377,'page_builder_5_gallery_description','A glimpse into our hygienic extraction machinery, thermal autoclaves, and cottage processing workshops.'),(5034,377,'_page_builder_5_gallery_description','field_6aa451191babe'),(5035,377,'page_builder_5_gallery_button','a:3:{s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"View Complete Facility Gallery\";s:3:\"url\";s:43:\"http://localhost/asalcanningcenter/gallery/\";s:6:\"target\";s:0:\"\";}'),(5036,377,'_page_builder_5_gallery_button','field_6aa4512b1babf'),(5037,377,'page_builder_5_gallery_items_0_gallery_image','173')