ssion: to bridge the gap between fresh agricultural harvest and long-term, pure natural preservation.\r\n\r\nOur center provides food-grade pulp extraction, tin canning, glass jar sealing, and retort pouch packing for households, farmers, and commercial brands alike with zero compromise on thermal sterilization standards.'),(7376,386,'_page_builder_2_story_description','field_6aa42930433a3'),(7377,386,'page_builder_2_story_values_0_value_icon','fa-solid fa-certificate'),(7378,386,'_page_builder_2_story_values_0_value_icon','field_6aa4297e433a5'),(7379,386,'page_builder_2_story_values_0_value_title','FSSAI Licensed Facility'),(7380,386,'_page_builder_2_story_values_0_value_title','field_6aa4299e433a6'),(7381,386,'page_builder_2_story_values_0_value_description','Strict quality assurance under Lic. No. 10718026000263.'),(7382,386,'_page_builder_2_story_values_0_value_description','field_6aa429ae433a7'),(7383,386,'page_builder_2_story_values_1_value_icon','fa-solid fa-people-group'),(7384,386,'_page_builder_2_story_values_1_value_icon','field_6aa4297e433a5'),(7385,386,'page_builder_2_story_values_1_value_title','Women Empowerment'),(7386,386,'_page_builder_2_story_values_1_value_title','field_6aa4299e433a6'),(7387,386,'page_builder_2_story_values_1_value_description','Over 1,000 women trained in independent cottage processing.'),(7388,386,'_page_builder_2_story_values_1_value_description','field_6aa429ae433a7'),(7389,386,'page_builder_2_story_values','2'),(7390,386,'_page_builder_2_story_values','field_6aa42945433a4'),(7391,386,'page_builder_3_sub_title','Featured Products'),(7392,386,'_page_builder_3_sub_title','field_6aa4408281316'),(7393,386,'page_builder_3_title','Flagship Preserves & Extracts'),(7394,386,'_page_builder_3_title','field_6aa440a381317'),(7395,386,'page_builder_3_description','Explore 100% natural fruit pulps, concentrated purees, jams, squashes, and traditional pickles.'),(7396,386,'_page_builder_3_description','field_6aa440ab81318'),(7397,386,'page_builder_3_featured_products','a:4:{i:0;s:3:\"129\";i:1;s:3:\"141\";i:2;s:3:\"142\";i:3;s:3:\"143\";}'),(7398,386,'_page_builder_3_featured_products','field_6aa440d381319'),(7399,386,'page_builder_3_view_more_button','a:3:{s:5:\"title\";s:33:\"View Full 11 Formulation Catalog \";s:3:\"url\";s:44:\"http://localhost/asalcanningcenter/products/\";s:6:\"target\";s:0:\"\";}'),(7400,386,'_page_builder_3_view_more_button','field_6aa445728131a'),(7401,386,'page_builder_4_process_tag','Standard Workflow'),(7402,386,'_page_builder_4_process_tag','field_6aa44a4f21cf6'),(7403,386,'page_builder_4_process_title','Our 4-Step Canning Process'),(7404,386,'_page_builder_4_process_title','field_6aa44a6921cf7'),(7405,386,'page_builder_4_process_description','Ensuring zero micro-flora activity and maximum natural nutrition retention.'),(7406,386,'_page_builder_4_process_description','field_6aa44a7621cf8'),(7407,386,'page_builder_4_process_steps_0_step_number','01'),(7408,386,'_page_builder_4_process_steps_0_step_number','field_6aa44a9521cfa'),(7409,386,'page_builder_4_process_steps_0_step_title','Harvesting & Brix Inspection'),(7410,386,'_page_builder_4_process_steps_0_step_title','field_6aa44aa821cfb'),(7411,386,'page_builder_4_process_steps_0_step_description','Hand-picked farm fresh fruit selection evaluated for peak maturity and natural Brix sweetness.'),(7412,386,'_page_builder_4_process_steps_0_step_description','field_6aa44ab621cfc'),(7413,386,'page_builder_4_process_steps_1_step_number','02'),(7414,386,'_page_builder_4_process_steps_1_step_number','field_6aa44a9521cfa'),(7415,386,'page_builder_4_process_steps_1_step_title','Sterile Cold Pulping'),(7416,386,'_page_builder_4_process_steps_1_step_title','field_6aa44aa821cfb'),(7417,386,'page_builder_4_process_steps_1_step_description','Mechanical pulp extraction under sterile cold-process without added synthetic colors or water dilution.'),(7418,386,'_page_builder_4_process_steps_1_step_description','field_6aa44ab621cfc'),(7419,386,'page_builder_4_process_steps_2_step_number','03'),(7420,386,'_page_builder_4_process_steps_2_step_number','field_6aa44a9521cfa'),(7421,386,'page_builder_4_process_steps_2_step_title','Thermal Pasteurization'),(7422,386,'_page_builder_4_process_steps_2_step_title','field_6aa44aa821cfb'),(7423,386,'page_builder_4_process_steps_2_step_description','Controlled thermal processing eliminating microbial activity while preserving natural fruit aroma.'),(7424,386,'_page_builder_4_process_steps_2_step_description','field_6aa44ab621cfc'),(7425,386,'page_builder_4_process_steps_3_step_number','04'),(7426,386,'_page_builder_4_process_steps_3_step_number','field_6aa44a9521cfa'),(7427,386,'page_builder_4_process_steps_3_step_title','Hermetic Seaming'),(7428,386,'_page_builder_4_process_steps_3_step_title','field_6aa44aa821cfb'),(7429,386,'page_builder_4_process_steps_3_step_description','Vacuum double-seam tin capping or retort pouch sealing for long-term ambient shelf life.'),(7430,386,'_page_builder_4_process_steps_3_step_description','field_6aa44ab621cfc'),(7431,386,'page_builder_4_process_steps','4'),(7432,386,'_page_builder_4_process_steps','field_6aa44a8821cf9'),(7433,386,'page_builder_5_faq_tag','Client Queries'),(7434,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_tag','field_6aa44c3bae1d2'),(7435,386,'page_builder_5_faq_title','Frequently Asked Questions'),(7436,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_title','field_6aa44c49ae1d3'),(7437,386,'page_builder_5_faq_description','Answers regarding FSSAI compliance, minimum batch sizes, and contract processing.'),(7438,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_description','field_6aa44c59ae1d4'),(7439,386,'page_builder_5_faq_items_0_faq_question','What is the minimum batch size for custom contract canning?'),(7440,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_items_0_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(7441,386,'page_builder_5_faq_items_0_faq_answer','We cater to small-scale farmers and cottage preservers starting from 25 KG batches up to commercial production runs of 1,000+ KG per day.'),(7442,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_items_0_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(7443,386,'page_builder_5_faq_items_1_faq_question','Is FSSAI certification included for packed items?'),(7444,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_items_1_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(7445,386,'page_builder_5_faq_items_1_faq_answer','Yes, all processing and hermetic canning is executed under Asal Canning Center\'s FSSAI License No. 10718026000263 following strict hygiene and thermal pasteurization rules.'),(7446,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_items_1_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(7447,386,'page_builder_5_faq_items_2_faq_question','Do you offer packaging options for export orders?'),(7448,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_items_2_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(7449,386,'page_builder_5_faq_items_2_faq_answer','Yes, we support hermetic tin canning (850g), retort pouch packing (1kg), glass bottles (500g), and ceramic jar packing suitable for international transport and long-term shelf storage.'),(7450,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_items_2_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(7451,386,'page_builder_5_faq_items_3_faq_question','How are fruit pulps preserved without artificial chemicals?'),(7452,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_items_3_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(7453,386,'page_builder_5_faq_items_3_faq_answer','We utilize thermal pasteurization, hermetic double-seam vacuum sealing, and flash freezing. This eliminates microbial activity while preserving 100% natural fruit taste, color, and nutrient profile without added chemical preservatives.'),(7454,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_items_3_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(7455,386,'page_builder_5_faq_items_4_faq_question','Can I request custom private label packaging for my food brand?'),(7456,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_items_4_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(7457,386,'page_builder_5_faq_items_4_faq_answer','Absolutely. We offer white-label contract processing and custom pouch/can/jar labeling with full regulatory compliance and nutritional breakdown for domestic and export markets.'),(7458,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_items_4_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(7459,386,'page_builder_5_faq_items_5_faq_question','Where is Asal Canning Center located & what are facility visiting hours?'),(7460,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_items_5_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(7461,386,'page_builder_5_faq_items_5_faq_answer','We are located in Paldi, Ahmedabad, Gujarat. Visitors and clients are welcome Monday through Saturday from 9:00 AM to 7:00 PM for facility tours and batch consultations.'),(7462,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_items_5_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(7463,386,'page_builder_5_faq_items','6'),(7464,386,'_page_builder_5_faq_items','field_6aa44c68ae1d5'),(7465,386,'page_builder_6_gallery_tag','Infrastructure & Operations'),(7466,386,'_page_builder_6_gallery_tag','field_6aa450fc1babc'),(7467,386,'page_builder_6_gallery_title','State-of-the-Art Canning Center & Facility'),(7468,386,'_page_builder_6_gallery_title','field_6aa4510a1babd'),(7469,386,'page_builder_6_gallery_description','A glimpse into our hygienic extraction machinery, thermal autoclaves, and cottage processing workshops.'),(7470,386,'_page_builder_6_gallery_description','field_6aa451191babe'),(7471,386,'page_builder_6_gallery_button','a:3:{s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"View Complete Facility Gallery\";s:3:\"url\";s:43:\"http://localhost/asalcanningcenter/gallery/\";s:6:\"target\";s:0:\"\";}'),(7472,386,'_page_builder_6_gallery_button','field_6aa4512b1babf'),(7473,386,'page_builder_6_gallery_items_0_gallery_image','173'),(7474,386,'_page_builder_6_gallery_items_0_gallery_image','field_6aa4514a1bac1'),(7475,386,'page_builder_6_gallery_items_0_gallery_title','Stainless Steel Fruit Pulper'),(7476,386,'_page_builder_6_gallery_items_0_gallery_title','field_6aa451601bac2'),(7477,386,'page_builder_6_gallery_items_0_gallery_subtitle','Hygienic Extraction Equipment'),(7478,386,'_page_builder_6_gallery_items_0_gallery_subtitle','field_6aa4516f1bac3'),(7479,386,'page_builder_6_gallery_items_