s executed under Asal Canning Center\'s FSSAI License No. 10718026000263 following strict hygiene and thermal pasteurization rules.'),(8364,398,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_1_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(8365,398,'page_builder_4_faq_items_2_faq_question','Do you offer packaging options for export orders?'),(8366,398,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_2_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(8367,398,'page_builder_4_faq_items_2_faq_answer','Yes, we support hermetic tin canning (850g), retort pouch packing (1kg), glass bottles (500g), and ceramic jar packing suitable for international transport and long-term shelf storage.'),(8368,398,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_2_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(8369,398,'page_builder_4_faq_items_3_faq_question','How are fruit pulps preserved without artificial chemicals?'),(8370,398,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_3_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(8371,398,'page_builder_4_faq_items_3_faq_answer','We utilize thermal pasteurization, hermetic double-seam vacuum sealing, and flash freezing. This eliminates microbial activity while preserving 100% natural fruit taste, color, and nutrient profile without added chemical preservatives.'),(8372,398,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_3_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(8373,398,'page_builder_4_faq_items_4_faq_question','Can I request custom private label packaging for my food brand?'),(8374,398,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_4_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(8375,398,'page_builder_4_faq_items_4_faq_answer','Absolutely. We offer white-label contract processing and custom pouch/can/jar labeling with full regulatory compliance and nutritional breakdown for domestic and export markets.'),(8376,398,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_4_faq_answer','field_6aa44c8bae1d7'),(8377,398,'page_builder_4_faq_items_5_faq_question','Where is Asal Canning Center located & what are facility visiting hours?'),(8378,398,'_page_builder_4_faq_items_5_faq_question','field_6aa44c79ae1d6'),(8379,398,'page_builder_4_faq_items_5_faq